    "DOCUMENT_BASE_CAPABILITY_MATERIALLY_AFFECTED_P12_REVALIDATION": false,
    "basis": "Under v6 (FIRST href-bearing live <base>, title/textarea excluded from discovery) the attempted LINK frontier is byte-identical to v4: the same 34 URLs, in the same order, from the same single parent page. No v6 URL is a re-based form of a v4 URL. The link 404s recur with the same generic server 404 body.",
