    "whatThisDoesNotProve": "Whether the root page contains a <base> element. The identical frontier is consistent with no href-bearing base, a base that resolves to the same directory as the page URL, or an unusable base that falls back to the page URL. No body is stored, and v6 does not persist which case applied.",
    "p12HtmlInspected": false,
    "networkVarianceNote": "three LINK URLs that returned the generic 404 under v4 returned transport errors under v6 (2 CONNECTION_RESET, 1 CONNECT_TIMEOUT); the robots.txt request also needed one transport retry. This is host-side variance, not a capability effect, and moved no page into or out of the evidence set."
